sec.p:
Regarding this adverse event, compared with enalapril or valsartan, sacubitril‐valsartan led to a numerically higher risk of symptomatic hypotension in all six trials with a pooled RR of 1.47, 95% CI 1.34–1.60, P < 0.00001 (P = 0.49 for heterogeneity; I
2 = 0%) (Figure

4
). We obtained the same results in subgroup analyses of different control groups (Supporting Information, 
Figure S2
).
